      "role": "user",
      "content": "800mg every 6 hours? that seems like a lot. i was thinking maybe just one or two pills at a time. are you sure i'm fine to take that much while on the eliquis? i'm just worried about any stomach issues or bleeding since my blood is thinner now.",
